1
00:00:00,090 --> 00:00:01,589
This Tesla can jump.

2
00:00:01,590 --> 00:00:02,469
But rocket thrust

3
00:00:02,470 --> 00:00:03,550
comes with a catch.

4
00:00:03,730 --> 00:00:04,729
These jets blast

5
00:00:04,730 --> 00:00:05,890
compressed air.

6
00:00:05,930 --> 00:00:06,689
Every burst

7
00:00:06,690 --> 00:00:07,689
uses some up.

8
00:00:07,690 --> 00:00:08,729
Keeping a car airborne

9
00:00:08,730 --> 00:00:09,929
on thrust means pushing

10
00:00:09,930 --> 00:00:11,589
against its entire weight.

11
00:00:11,590 --> 00:00:12,149
Bigger tanks

12
00:00:12,150 --> 00:00:13,189
can buy more time,

13
00:00:13,190 --> 00:00:13,929
but add weight

14
00:00:13,930 --> 00:00:15,090
and need protection.

15
00:00:15,330 --> 00:00:16,770
Then comes balance.

16
00:00:16,810 --> 00:00:17,629
Thrust that misses

17
00:00:17,630 --> 00:00:18,449
the center of mass

18
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:19,590
can make it rotate.

19
00:00:19,610 --> 00:00:20,229
Other thrusters

20
00:00:20,230 --> 00:00:21,049
can correct that,

21
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:21,969
but those corrections

22
00:00:21,970 --> 00:00:22,950
use air too.

23
00:00:23,190 --> 00:00:24,089
And fire a jet

24
00:00:24,090 --> 00:00:25,210
near loose gravel?

25
00:00:25,250 --> 00:00:25,869
That blast

26
00:00:25,870 --> 00:00:27,490
can send debris flying.

27
00:00:27,790 --> 00:00:28,269
None of this

28
00:00:28,270 --> 00:00:29,250
breaks physics.

29
00:00:29,350 --> 00:00:30,429
It gives a sports car

30
00:00:30,430 --> 00:00:31,690
spacecraft problems.

31
00:00:31,970 --> 00:00:33,049
Full Roadster breakdown

32
00:00:33,050 --> 00:00:34,210
in the linked video.
